<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήθ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦθος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unwonted, strange</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					567
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δώματα</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				583.10
			</span></i>. Adv.-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θως</span>
			<i>unexpectedly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unused to</i> a thing, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				146b
			</span></i>,al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ κατακούειν, τοῦ
				προπηλακίζεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				1.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>strange in manner, unlike oneself</i>, prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγηθής</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				869
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without character</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραγῳδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1450a25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1460a11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
